  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are the bane of those who believe they stand atop the world.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 15, Giantslayer, base attack bonus +10.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The bonus granted by your Giantslayer feat when performing or resisting a combat maneuver against a foe who is at least 1 size category larger than yourself increases to +2 per size category larger than yourself the opponent is. In addition, you can now use combat maneuvers against targets 2 size categories larger than would normally be allowed (instead of just 1 size category as allowed by the Giantslayer feat).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc101\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
